### single-quoted lowercase range in tr misses accented letters
tr 'a-z' 'A-Z' < names.txt
>>> SC2018 1:4
>>> SC2019 1:10

### unquoted lowercase range in tr
printf '%s\n' "$hostname" | tr a-z _
>>> SC2018 1:32
>>> SC2154 1:16

### range text without a tr command is ignored
a-z n-za-m
>>> none

### bracketed lowercase range gets the bracket warning instead
tr '[a-z]' '_' < input.log
>>> SC2021 1:4
